{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1534132-garou-creation-question","id":1534132,"title":"Garou creation question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-13T09:09:18-07:00","id":1534132,"title":"Garou creation question","content":"Hello everyone! I am a novice in WTA, preparing for my first game. So, I have a question, concerning Garou. My friend we played VTM with, and that played WTA before told me that Garou can only normaly be born to a Garou and a Kinfolk and cannot be born to a male or a female human/wolf and a Garou. This is something that I actually didn't find in a rulebook to prove with, so is this statement false or am I missing something? I wanted to create a character that was born to a human father and a Garou mother, so it kinda ruins my concept a bit.<br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28209-kaelharan","name":"Kaelharan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T09:44:56-07:00","id":1534135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kaelharan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1534132-garou-creation-question#post1534132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello everyone! I am a novice in WTA, preparing for my first game. So, I have a question, concerning Garou. My friend we played VTM with, and that played WTA before told me that Garou can only normaly be born to a Garou and a Kinfolk and cannot be born to a male or a female human/wolf and a Garou. This is something that I actually didn't find in a rulebook to prove with, so is this statement false or am I missing something? I wanted to create a character that was born to a human father and a Garou mother, so it kinda ruins my concept a bit.<br /> Thanks in advance!</div> </div> </div> </div>Your friend has it wrong. With kinfolk, garou are more likely, but a garou can breed with a human and it can result in a garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T09:50:25-07:00","id":1534136,"title":"","content":"Your concept is fine. It happens less often and the relationship is usually rockier, but Garou can produce Garou with non-Kin. Perhaps your friend read about the Rokea in older books and thought it applied to the Garou and other Fera, because I don't recall any book mentioning this being a hurdle for the Garou (or, really, anyone who wasn't a wereshark).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}